  "claimBoundary": "A pass establishes one bounded selected-topology commit-without-confirmation case: the original write may commit, but the Gateway records an unresolved intent, quarantines, does not retry, and a fresh Gateway refuses recovery. Passing cryptographic bundle verification does not make the semantically incomplete turn resumable and does not close B12."
